7branch-Level-8\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-8"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-08-28T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"d067d56745d08d37385711d6a22cba6e623fb54f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract console interactions into Ui class","messageBody":"Move input reading, response formatting, task display, and user-facing messages out of Lobby so the application entry point can focus on command flow. Preserve all existing console text and EOF behavior while introducing the first required responsibility-focused class.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":201,"deletions":88}}},{"hash":"97c1faa5e2d7d240406f792584cb6c857ead12da","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract task persistence into Storage class","messageBody":"Move the save path, atomic file writes, escaped-field parsing, task reconstruction, and recoverable load results out of Lobby. Inject Storage into the command flow so Lobby retains mutation rollback and user-facing error handling while filesystem and data-format responsibilities remain together.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":172,"deletions":152}}},{"hash":"8eb0cbc42a540b48d5d2b0e232cc29ba1fa04189","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract command interpretation into Parser class","messageBody":"Move command recognition, task-number parsing, marker handling, validation, and task construction out of Lobby. Keep command execution and task-list bounds checks in Lobby so this increment establishes a focused parsing boundary without changing runtime behavior or prematurely mixing in the TaskList refactor.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":172,"deletions":150}}},{"hash":"c6db10aa44322a2a270facd3bd23a5f2c66a3025","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Encapsulate task collection in TaskList","messageBody":"Introduce TaskList as the owner of the in-memory collection, with one-based lookup, validation, insertion, deletion, marking, and unmarking operations.